A tab-bearing value round-trips through the file unmangled; a literal newline is not typeable via the CLI (shlex, one invocation per line).

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
status: draft
sp: 0
---

Body.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md "note=a	b"
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 ---
 status: draft
 sp: 0
+note: "a\tb"
 ---
 
 Body.
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: note=a	b
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
status: draft
sp: 0
note: "a\tb"
---

Body.
-- exit --
0
